---
title: AdviseCare - Sequence Diagram SD-33 - Generate and Export Report
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor PH as Programme Head
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as ReportsController
    participant S as ReportService
    participant XW as IExcelWriter / IPdfWriter
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    PH->>W: Choose date range and filters
    W->>C: GET /api/Reports/cases?from&to&advisorId&supportType...
    C->>S: GetCaseReportAsync(request)
    S->>S: Check both dates (inclusive UTC days, to not before from)
    S->>R: Cases opened in the range with student, advisor, subject, category
    R->>DB: SELECT
    S-->>W: Rows with days to close
    PH->>W: Export as xlsx
    W->>C: GET /api/Reports/cases/export?...&format=xlsx
    C->>S: ExportCaseReportAsync(ProgrammeHeadId, request)
    S->>R: Same query
    alt format = csv
        S->>S: Build UTF-8 CSV with BOM
    else format = pdf
        S->>XW: WriteTable(title, subtitle, headers, rows)
    else xlsx
        S->>XW: WriteRows(sheet, headers, rows)
    end
    S->>S: Log activity reportExported
    S-->>C: ExportCaseReportResponse (bytes, content type, file name)
    C-->>W: File download
